warning[shift-bound]: bitshift expressions in template bounds are not portable
   ┌ test.idl:2:52
   │
 2 │         typedef sequence<sequence<long, 1 << 4>, 1 << 8> NestedSeq;
   ·                                                    ^^ this shift operator
   └──
 help: consider using a constant instead
 note: other IDL compilers may not support bitshift expressions in template bounds

